# =============================================================================
# RMS-MIS server-side environment variables
#
# CURRENTLY NONE ARE REQUIRED.
#
# The only serverless function in the project is api/reports/pdf.js (PDF
# generation), which needs no credentials. The password-recovery endpoint that
# used SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY has been removed, so this
# project no longer stores or needs a service-role key.
#
# Keep this file as a template should a future server function need secrets.
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) for `vercel dev`, or set the values in
# Vercel > Settings > Environment Variables.
#
# !! NEVER prefix any secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_ !!
#    NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into browser JavaScript at build time.
#    A service-role key bypasses RLS and can read/write every table, so it must
#    only ever exist in the Vercel server runtime - never in frontend/ or git.
# =============================================================================

# SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co

# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
